  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 5715636224
    m_Localized: WZNY, night desk. The storm has knocked out power in parts of the north side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8202858496
    m_Localized: Fear has tripled the number of false reports since yesterday. Psychologists remind us that suspicion is natural, but paranoia spreads fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10224513024
    m_Localized: ...look through the peephole...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12044840960
    m_Localized: In the nineties, the Butcher was never seen coming or going. To his neighbors, he was nobody special.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14301376512
    m_Localized: Police confirm the Halley boarding house victim died between one and two in the morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15333175296
    m_Localized: There are still no suspects. Chief Cole asks anyone who was on Halley Street last night to come forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15991681024
    m_Localized: Don't open your door to strangers. Not even to familiar faces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16654381056
    m_Localized: WZNY. Stay home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
